x + 0
     => x

1 * (x + 0)
     => x + 0
     => x

2 + 3 * 4
     => 2 + 12
     => 14

(y - y) * z + w * 1
     => 0 * z + w
     => 0 + w
     => w

a + b + (a + b)
     => 2 * (a + b)

0 * x + 1 * (y + 2 * 3)
     => 0 + (y + 2 * 3)
     => y + 2 * 3
     => y + 6

f(x) + g(y)
     => h(x, x) + y
